        "rationale": "Role assignments were made based on the nature of the tasks: 'handle question', 'Provide feedback', and 'Explain solution' were assigned to a Customer Service Representative, while 'Handle 1st level issue' and 'Handle 2nd level issue' were assigned to Level 1 and Level 2 Help Desk Analysts, respectively. Hourly costs were taken directly from the provided European (EUR) averages. Task durations were estimated using industry benchmarks for Average Handle Time (AHT) and resolution times for 1st and 2nd level support. For tasks like 'Provide feedback' and 'Explain solution', which lack specific standalone benchmarks, durations were conservatively estimated to be similar to general customer service inquiries, as they are often integrated into broader interaction times. Gateway probabilities reflect typical customer service and help desk escalation rates and first contact resolution targets.",
